§ `Tests of regulation 16 with the regulations that modify it`

-- Limb (a): regulation 23 disapplies it for the daily living component only. (component, regulation 23 disapplies, limb (a) on its own terms)
#ASSERT `reg 16(a) as modified: limb (a) is met` `the daily living component` `with` TRUE `and` FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`reg 16(a) as modified: limb (a) is met` `the mobility component` `with` TRUE `and` FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`reg 16(a) as modified: limb (a) is met` `the daily living component` `with` FALSE `and` FALSE)
#ASSERT `reg 16(a) as modified: limb (a) is met` `the mobility component` `with` FALSE `and` TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 16(a) as modified: limb (a) is met` `the daily living component` `with` FALSE `and` TRUE

-- Limb (b): (component, reg 21, reg 22, reg 23 disapplies, reg 23A(1), on its own terms)
