#ASSERT `reg 16(b) as modified: limb (b) is met` `the mobility component` `with` TRUE `and` FALSE `and` FALSE `and` FALSE `and` FALSE
#ASSERT `reg 16(b) as modified: limb (b) is met` `the mobility component` `with` FALSE `and` TRUE `and` FALSE `and` FALSE `and` FALSE
#ASSERT `reg 16(b) as modified: limb (b) is met` `the mobility component` `with` FALSE `and` FALSE `and` FALSE `and` TRUE `and` FALSE
#ASSERT `reg 16(b) as modified: limb (b) is met` `the daily living component` `with` FALSE `and` FALSE `and` TRUE `and` FALSE `and` FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`reg 16(b) as modified: limb (b) is met` `the mobility component` `with` FALSE `and` FALSE `and` TRUE `and` FALSE `and` FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`reg 16(b) as modified: limb (b) is met` `the daily living component` `with` FALSE `and` FALSE `and` FALSE `and` FALSE `and` FALSE)

-- Limb (c): (component, reg 20, reg 23 disapplies, reg 23A(1A), reg 23ZA, on its own terms)
