#ASSERT `reg 16(c) as modified: limb (c) is met` `the mobility component` `with` FALSE `and` FALSE `and` FALSE `and` FALSE `and` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `reg 16(c) as modified: limb (c) is met` `the mobility component` `with` TRUE `and` FALSE `and` FALSE `and` FALSE `and` FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 16(c) as modified: limb (c) is met` `the daily living component` `with` FALSE `and` TRUE `and` FALSE `and` FALSE `and` FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 16(c) as modified: limb (c) is met` `the mobility component` `with` FALSE `and` TRUE `and` FALSE `and` FALSE `and` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `reg 16(c) as modified: limb (c) is met` `the mobility component` `with` FALSE `and` FALSE `and` TRUE `and` FALSE `and` FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
