-- Regulation 23ZA alone treats limb (c) as not satisfied, even if it would be on its own terms.
#ASSERT `reg 16(c) as modified: limb (c) is met` `the mobility component` `with` FALSE `and` FALSE `and` FALSE `and` TRUE `and` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `reg 16(c) as modified: limb (c) is met` `the daily living component` `with` FALSE `and` FALSE `and` FALSE `and` TRUE `and` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Regulation 23ZA against regulation 20, regulation 23 (daily living only) and regulation 23A(1A): the text does not say.
#ASSERT `reg 16(c) as modified: limb (c) is met` `the mobility component` `with` TRUE `and` FALSE `and` FALSE `and` TRUE `and` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `reg 16(c) as modified: limb (c) is met` `the daily living component` `with` FALSE `and` TRUE `and` FALSE `and` TRUE `and` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `reg 16(c) as modified: limb (c) is met` `the mobility component` `with` FALSE `and` FALSE `and` TRUE `and` TRUE `and` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Regulation 23 does not reach the mobility component, so it does not meet regulation 23ZA there.
#ASSERT `reg 16(c) as modified: limb (c) is met` `the mobility component` `with` FALSE `and` TRUE `and` FALSE `and` TRUE `and` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `reg 16(c) is deemed or disapplied by another regulation` `the mobility component` `with` FALSE `and` TRUE `and` FALSE EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `reg 16(c) is deemed or disapplied by another regulation` `the daily living component` `with` FALSE `and` TRUE `and` FALSE EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 16(c) is deemed or disapplied by another regulation` `the mobility component` `with` TRUE `and` FALSE `and` FALSE EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 16(c) is deemed or disapplied by another regulation` `the mobility component` `with` FALSE `and` FALSE `and` TRUE EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 16(c) is deemed or disapplied by another regulation` `the mobility component` `with` FALSE `and` FALSE `and` FALSE EQUALS FALSE

-- Regulation 16 as a whole: (a) (b) (c) (d).
#ASSERT `reg 16: the outcome on the day` TRUE TRUE (JUST TRUE) TRUE EQUALS `the conditions of regulation 16 are met`
#ASSERT `reg 16: the outcome on the day` FALSE TRUE (JUST TRUE) TRUE EQUALS `the conditions of regulation 16 are not met`
#ASSERT `reg 16: the outcome on the day` TRUE FALSE (JUST TRUE) TRUE EQUALS `the conditions of regulation 16 are not met`
#ASSERT `reg 16: the outcome on the day` TRUE TRUE (JUST FALSE) TRUE EQUALS `the conditions of regulation 16 are not met`
#ASSERT `reg 16: the outcome on the day` TRUE TRUE (JUST TRUE) FALSE EQUALS `the conditions of regulation 16 are not met`
#ASSERT `reg 16: the outcome on the day` TRUE TRUE NOTHING TRUE EQUALS `the text does not say whether the conditions of regulation 16 are met`
-- A limb that fails settles the matter even where limb (c) is not covered.
#ASSERT `reg 16: the outcome on the day` FALSE TRUE NOTHING TRUE EQUALS `the conditions of regulation 16 are not met`
#ASSERT `reg 16: the outcome on the day` TRUE FALSE NOTHING TRUE EQUALS `the conditions of regulation 16 are not met`
